WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:33.230
Amamiya-san!

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:36.150
Hey, what about this?

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.780
Sounds good. It might be a secret place.

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:41.490
Hey, look at that.

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:42.990
I knew it.

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:46.460
Amamiya-san's with Sakurai-kun.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:48.000
Sa-yu-ri!

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.290
A-Ayame!

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:50.540
Have you seen Aoba-kun?

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:52.380
Oh, Aoba-kun...

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:55.130
He went out with Kasuga-san, right?

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:56.550
I see.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.430
Our free time is over.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:07.770
Yeah. We've gotta get back soon, or they'll get mad at us.

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:11.900
I can't stand it. I still want to be alone with you.

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:13.070
Kasuga-san.

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.440
Y-You know...

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:18.900
Riku-kun, do you...

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:23.450
Kasuga-san?

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:29.540
Kasuga-san!

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:32.960
I thought I could endure it.

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:36.170
Why? You should've been resting!

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:41.260
But I wanted to spend time with you during our school trip.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.970
It looks like I messed up.

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:55.940
I...

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:57.650
I...

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.740
From here up are all repeat lines from other episodes, dunno if I should do memories or not >_> but I reckon it is a memory so I used that style.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.740
I want to see you, Aoba-san!

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:21.930
Quiet, please!

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:25.470
We can't be in "School Trip Mode" forever!

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.640
Okay.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.430
Your final exams are coming up soon.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:32.730
Make sure you're well prepared for it, okay everyone?

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.900
Okay!

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:38.780
Good. Let's work hard all day today, all right?

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.700
Oh, man. Not more exams.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:47.240
Oh, what'll I do?

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.790
I haven't studied at all, and the exams are right around the corner!

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.370
That what you ALWAYS say.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:57.250
Geez. Christmas is coming up, and with that, the winter vacation.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.840
It's one big event after another.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.800
It really is special.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.310
What the hell?!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.640
This isn't good!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.060
At this rate, I'll...

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.810
Hey, Suzuki!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:17.900
Let me copy your notes!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.110
Wh-What about you, Kayama?

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.410
I'm gonna get them for this!

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.830
We're royally screwed now. We didn't study at all.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.170
Should we go to the library?

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.260
Geez.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:51.430
Exciting Feelings

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:51.600
Delete Display Message Sub-menu

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:59.440
Yayoi Mina

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:59.440
After School on Monday

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:59.440
Are you free after school on
Monday? I'm looking forward
to seeing your souvenir.

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:11.950
Exciting Thought

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.460
It's so cute!

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.960
Thank you so much, Aoba-san!

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.130
I'll treasure this!

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.800
Oh, it's not that special.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:31.810
U-Um...

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:34.890
About that voice message I left you...

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:38.480
Um...

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:41.400
I didn't know what to say, so that's why...

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.440
I couldn't express myself very well.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.070
I'm so sorry.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.990
I have something that I have to do.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.160
I'll see you again.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:27.070
Aoba-san. I want to see you!

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:39.460
I...

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.520
That exam is coming soon!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:01.940
I finally got the notes from someone who actually studied, but I don't know where to start.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.980
Now we'll be able to pass the exams!

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.780
I've got to do something, or I'll be held back again!

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.450
Oh, Doujima.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.410
Are you worried about being held back?

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.410
Yeah. That's not like you.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.990
Fools!

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:20.540
If I get held back again, I'll be a year behind Amamiya-san!

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.420
Oh. Now I get it.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:32.130
I'll do whatever it takes to graduate from this school with Amamiya-san! Just you watch!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.560
K-Kasuga-san!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.900
R-Riku-kun!

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:49.320
Um...

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:50.820
Are you all right?

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.990
Oh... Yeah.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.200
Um...

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:06.840
Oh yeah. Riku-kun, if it's all right with you, will you...

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:13.300
Hey! What are you doing?

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:16.680
Get your ass over here! Now!

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.260
Oh, right.

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:22.180
I've gotta go, or there won't be any seats left in the library.

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:24.600
Sorry about that.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.270
I won't forgive you.

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:30.650
I don't mind, but I can't let you ignore us.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:32.900
Riku-kun.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.080
What happened to your enthusiasm?

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:47.040
It disappeared at the critical moment.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:48.460
I guess.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:49.710
Right, Aoba?

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.170
Hey, Aoba.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:53.970
Did something happen?

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.470
He's right, Riku-kun.

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:01.350
You were acting strange when Kasuga-san ran into you.

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:06.350
Aoba, have you finally decided to go after Amamiya instead of the other girls?

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:12.900
H-Hey.

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.860
Is he right, Aoba?

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.990
But your target is formidable.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.370
You'll be fine.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.580
Aoba can do it.

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.910
H-Hey, wait a second, everyone.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.410
Why are you bringing that up?

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.250
So? What'll we do?

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:28.500
First comes the confession.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.170
But we don't know her e-mail address.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.170
We'll write a letter.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:35.130
No. We're men, so we can't screw around.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.430
Let's ask her to come to the gym after school...

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.470
Just a second, you guys.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.140
What are you talking about?

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:42.850
A-Ayame!

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:44.850
And Amamiya-san too!

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:46.640
Listen up, all of you.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:50.020
Don't invent rumors about other people right in front of them.

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:51.860
Hey, Ayame.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.190
That's enough.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.990
No, it's not.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:56.570
They're talking about you. Look.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.610
At least tell them you're not happy.

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:02.160
Um...

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.040
Well...

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:09.920
Aoba-kun.

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:17.380
Hey, Aoba!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:18.880
Riku-kun?

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.260
What's up with him?

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:21.970
Who knows?

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:38.860
Hey.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:40.110
Wait.

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:44.660
What's his problem?

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:06.930
What on earth am I doing?

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:28.870
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:40.880
Now then. Who should I call on to read for us next?

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:43.510
Okay, Aoba-kun.

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.060
Hey, Aoba!

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.810
She's calling on you. Turn to page 65.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:51.940
Um...

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:56.940
Aoba-kun.

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.780
Didn't you hear me again?

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:01.700
No.

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:04.110
What's wrong with you these days?

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.240
It's not like you.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.120
I'm sorry.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.540
Okay. That's all for today.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.460
If you're worried about something, I'll be there for you. Okay?

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:26.850
DING-DONG-DANG-DONG!

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:30.020
We will now begin a new Student Council event!

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:34.020
Today's target will be the same as yesterday's target: Aoba-kun from class 2-A.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:38.690
Whoever catches him will receive a special crown from the Student Council.

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.660
I want that crown!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.340
All right!

00:12:58.920 --> 00:12:59.880
Well done!

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:04.510
Aoba-kun.

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:05.720
What's wrong?

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.720
You've lost twice in a row now.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.720
You never lost at one of these before.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.560
Are you feeling sick?

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.770
I only won because I was lucky.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:23.570
What do you mean?

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:24.700
Hey, Aoba-kun?

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:41.250
Please look
after the animals

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.670
Here. Sorry about this. It's my leftovers from lunch.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.270
Hey, Hiyoko-kun.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.480
This has never happened to me before.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.520
I don't even know how I feel.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:04.150
What should I do?

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:05.440
Don't be afraid to answer!

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:10.500
You have to answer your own questions. You only ask me for help when you're down in the dumps.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:17.370
"You have to answer your own questions. You only ask me for help when you're down in the dumps."

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:25.010
Please look
after the animals

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:20.210
I'm sorry.

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:35.700
Quickly become someone who is reliable every time, Riku!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:58.960
Riku-kun.

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:02.170
I guess he's still worried about what happened during our school trip.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:10.880
Aoba-san.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:21.650
A-Aoba-kun.

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:24.400
Oh. Amamiya-san.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.530
You're pretty late.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.780
I've been waiting for ages.

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:31.280
Wh-Why?

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:34.450
Say, wanna walk home together?

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.160
Time really flies.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.580
It's already December.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.580
Yeah. That's true.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:48.300
The Culture Festival took place not long ago, and now our final exams are coming up.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:49.460
Say, have you been studying?

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.800
No, not really.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.220
Thank goodness. Neither have I.

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:57.310
But... you get good grades.

00:15:58.010 --> 00:15:59.470
To be honest, that's not easy.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:03.730
I have to stay up all night for days before exams to get ready.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:05.770
Really?

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:07.320
No   pe!

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.450
I study hard, but I can't go that far.

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.110
Oh.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.490
Then, you don't need to study very much.

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:20.160
I guess that's what everyone thinks.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:24.790
Staying up all night would be going too far, but I usually study when I'm at home.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:25.500
I see.

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:30.340
A lot has happened during the second semester.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:31.470
Yeah.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:37.260
We were on the Culture Festival committee together, and we went on a school trip...

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:38.310
Yeah.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.890
I wonder if we'll be able to experience days like these next year.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.390
I'm sure we will.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.150
I see.

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.690
"I'm sure we will," eh?

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.820
Oh, it's nothing.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.070
I'm taking the bus from here.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:57.370
Okay.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.580
Well then, I'll see you tomorrow.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:06.250
Yeah.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.040
See you tomorrow.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:08.960
Um... Aoba-kun.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:11.130
You've been depressed lately.

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.680
I hope you cheer up soon.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:45.120
Store sign says: Chachamaru Bookstore.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.000
I...

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:50.170
can't leave things the way they are. I know that.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:51.500
But...

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:53.090
But I...

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.420
What should I do?

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:03.640
I-Inukai-kun!

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:07.270
Pharmacy

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:06.390
Oh, it's you, Aoba.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:15.570
I get it now.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:17.150
Yeah.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:19.780
This has never happened to me before.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.080
So I don't know what to do.

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:26.000
Ridiculous.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.420
Hey. Inukai-kun!

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.800
Listen. You're just running away.

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:37.720
Be brave, even if it scares you.

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:45.560
Get up.

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:48.310
Get up, I said!

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:52.690
Don't move.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.880
Hmph. You don't have to run away, do you?

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.460
You should have the answer to your worries now.

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:17.960
Don't just stand there.

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.270
What a shock.

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:35.690
He might be right.

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:18.440
Riku... san.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.330
Hey, what'll we do?

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:34.290
Riku-kun must be worried about something.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.460
Now it's our turn!

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:41.300
As his good friends, we know what's troubling him.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.090
Doujima-chan.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:44.720
You...

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.550
You have a strong sense of friendship.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:47.470
Of course I do!

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:49.180
That's the only thing I'm strong at!

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:49.850
Everyone!

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:51.310
We've gotta hurry, or we'll be late!

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.560
A-Aoba!

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.020
Come on!

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:00.360
Yeah!

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:16.710
Aoba Riku

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:16.710
I can't say it right now,
but someday, I will tell you
how I truly feel about you.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.670
What's wrong, Tsukasa?

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:23.010
You're smiling from ear to ear!

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:28.510
I-It's nothing.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:29.890
Y-Yeah.

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:32.390
Yeah, that spot was awesome!

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:37.100
Hey, Aoba.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.270
Let's go hang out after school.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:39.650
Where should we go?

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:40.690
To the library again?

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:42.280
Let me see...

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:45.740
Let's go out somewhere for a change of pace.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:47.200
Yeah!

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:48.360
Not a bad idea!

00:21:48.360 --> 00:21:49.820
Let's go fishing!

00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:51.410
You'll fall in again.

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:52.410
What are you saying?

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:55.410
I've got my Final Move!

00:22:19.990 --> 00:22:27.520
My heart is overflowing!

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:42.820
My heart is overflowing!Even if I try to conceal my feelings for you,

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:48.690
I can't help blushing when our eyes meet.

00:22:50.920 --> 00:22:57.380
I kept this a secret from my friends,

00:22:58.190 --> 00:23:03.830
Because I didn't want to be teased.

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:13.160
The important thing that nobody knows,

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:20.300
I'll only tell to you.

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:25.080
These gently falling flower petals

00:23:25.480 --> 00:23:28.660
are sneaking into my heart.

00:23:29.100 --> 00:23:35.070
I want to make your heart flutter.

00:23:36.360 --> 00:23:39.640
It's okay to have hopes

00:23:40.010 --> 00:23:43.310
for the future we await, right?

00:23:43.640 --> 00:23:49.540
My heart is overflowing!

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:52.700
Next Episode Preview

00:23:51.150 --> 00:23:53.250
Hey, Inukai-kun! It's Christmas!

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:54.620
Poster says: Tsumugino High School. You make the best couple! Brought to you by the Student Council. Christmas Cosplay Event. It's official!!

00:23:53.740 --> 00:23:54.360
Shut it.

00:23:54.450 --> 00:23:56.870
What should I get for Riku-kun?

00:23:57.090 --> 00:23:58.370
I'm at such a loss!

00:23:58.700 --> 00:23:59.580
I said, shut up!

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:00.750
The winner will receive... Can you believe it?! They will receive a book entitled "The Legendary Club Secrets."

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:00.750
Entry requirements: boy-girl couples only.
You can check it out on the day. Additionally, all guests should
bring a lovely present to exchange. (Girls should wrap their presents
with a red ribbon. Boys should wrap their presents with a green ribbon.)
Ladies and gentlemen, get your groove on!!

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:01.370
Why don't I knit a sweater?

00:24:01.370 --> 00:24:03.120
Or what about some mittens?

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:04.670
I said, SHUT UP!

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:07.800
Oh no! I can't knit to save my life!

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:10.090
I knew it. I'll have to go and buy a present!

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:12.870
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:13.200 --> 00:24:14.470
An Exciting Christmas.

00:24:14.690 --> 00:24:15.580
Please watch it.

00:24:16.040 --> 00:24:18.970
What was she trying to say?
